flowchart LR
  A[Commit / MR<br/>to main] --> B[Build] --> C[Unit + lint tests] --> D[Package<br/>artifact]
  D --> E[Deploy dev] --> F[Deploy staging<br/>+ integration tests]
  F --> G{Prod gate}
  G -->|"Continuous DELIVERY:<br/>human approves"| H[Production]
  G -->|"Continuous DEPLOYMENT:<br/>automatic"| H
  subgraph CI["CI: integrate + verify every change"]
    A
    B
    C
    D
  end
  subgraph CD["CD: release the SAME artifact through environments"]
    E
    F
    G
    H
  end
  classDef ci fill:#d1ecf1,stroke:#17a2b8,stroke-width:2px,color:#000
  classDef cd fill:#d4edda,stroke:#28a745,stroke-width:2px,color:#000
  classDef gate fill:#fff3cd,stroke:#e0a800,stroke-width:2px,color:#000
  class A,B,C,D ci
  class E,F,H cd
  class G gate
